{"id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","title":"Hilbert Space","display":"df-hilbert-space — Hilbert Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hilbert-space","aliases":["58-df-hilbert-space"],"display":"df-hilbert-space — Hilbert Space","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hilbert-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hilbert-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-space — Hilbert Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V\">\\(H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (inner-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\)</span> (Banach-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\">\\(\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\\)</span> (induced norm)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,\\nu_B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,\\nu_B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The core predicate carries the scalar field and vector-space operations required by the five-argument inner-product and Banach-space signatures.</li>\n<li>Hilbert spaces are complete inner product spaces.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> is the canonical infinite-dimensional example.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)$ (inner-product predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Banach}_S$ (Banach-space predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(H,k,+_H,\\odot_H,\\nu_B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}space\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":true},{"tex":"L^2","display":false}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"498d9a7dee7a4d0a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4366f310672969df","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B,k,+_H,\\odot_H)$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]] 的五元结构接口，$k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}$。"},{"id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2$ (Hilbert-space predicates, see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])"},{"id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])"},{"id":"cae2c5219270d535","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6ace29e12d6a2ff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])"},{"id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"75b2e6453cca837c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])"},{"id":"bcf5e4a644e3e929","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])"},{"id":"b2726dc25b01fa48","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8cd200016e351244","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"]